    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d617">

                <pb facs="0773" n="665" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg665"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Marquis Rudini to
                        Baron Fava</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1891-03-15"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 15,
                    1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I confirm my telegram. I do not doubt that you have obtained immediately
                    energetic measures. If the slightest agitation takes place, you are authorized
                    to present a formal protest, with the reserve of asking later the satisfaction
                    to which we are entitled.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rudini</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
